WEBVTT

00:04:28.294 --> 00:04:30.273
Siku moja, wanapata mgeni mpya,

00:04:32.746 --> 00:04:34.513
familia ya bakteria Capulet.

00:04:34.537 --> 00:04:35.687
(Kicheko)

00:04:36.157 --> 00:04:38.947
Kila kitu ni sawa,
alimradi wanafanya kazi kwa pamoja.

00:04:40.377 --> 00:04:43.383
Lakini kitu kisichopangwa kinatokea.

00:04:44.449 --> 00:04:48.667
Romeo wa Montague anakua na mahusiano
na Juliet wa Capulet.

00:04:48.691 --> 00:04:49.841
(Kicheko)

00:04:50.978 --> 00:04:53.873
Na ndio, wanagawiana chembe za urithi.

00:04:53.897 --> 00:04:56.006
(Kicheko)

00:04:58.260 --> 00:05:01.381
Sasa, uhamisho wa kinasaba unaweza
kuwa hatari kwa wakina Montague